{"checks": ["PASS  01_keys_unique: Every table's key is unique and never NULL.", "PASS  02_orders_have_session_and_person: Every order has a person; an order with a session_key is in fct_sessions and, unless its own purchase carried a user_id, has that session's person and rule; an order with no session (a cookieless purchase) is in the documented no-session bucket; every order line belongs to an order.", "PASS  03_order_revenue_reconciles: Per source: fct_orders (count, zero-value orders, revenue, tax, shipping, distinct transaction ids) equals the purchase events in stg_events after the transaction_id dedupe; kept + dropped purchases equal all purchase events; fct_sessions orders + zero_value_orders and revenue equal the fct_orders that have a session.", "PASS  04_marts_reconcile: Per source: mart_campaign_daily sessions, engaged sessions, orders and revenue equal fct_sessions, and its cost equals campaign_costs on the dates the source has sessions; mart_funnel_daily sessions and converted sessions equal fct_sessions, and every funnel step is no larger than the one before it.", "PASS  05_sample_row_counts: ga4_sample: every raw export row is accounted for. Rows in the export = rows staged + exact duplicates removed, and the documented number of exact duplicates in the sample is 0.", "PASS  06_sessions_cover_events: Per source: every event with a session id is in exactly one fct_sessions row (distinct session keys and event totals agree), every device in stg_events is in int_identity, and every session has a person.", "PASS  07_identity: No person has two user_ids (in int_identity or in fct_sessions); every device's person and rule follow from its user_ids, and every session's from its own user_id and its device; user_ids are opaque 32-hex account ids, as the tagging plan requires. One row per kind of problem, with a count and an example.", "PASS  08_no_email_like_strings: No email-like string (name@domain.tld, raw or URL-encoded as %40) in user_id, person_id, page fields or search terms. Reports counts per column, never the values.", "PASS  09_synthetic_is_labelled: Synthetic data says so: every campaign_costs and products cost row is flagged synthetic, and both tables' descriptions say SYNTHETIC."], "checks_line": "9/9 checks passed", "collection": "job_ids", "command": "make build-incremental", "ended_at": "2026-09-29T06:58:14.754080Z", "exit_code": 0, "fingerprints": {"tagline_marts.fct_order_items": {"columns": 20, "fingerprint": "15085:-5383937310389835766:328745309287595321588", "float_digits": null, "rows": 15085, "schema": "gross_margin_rate:FLOAT:NULLABLE,gross_margin_usd:FLOAT:NULLABLE,is_catalog_product:BOOLEAN:NULLABLE,item_brand:STRING:NULLABLE,item_category:STRING:NULLABLE,item_id:STRING:NULLABLE,item_name:STRING:NULLABLE,item_variant:STRING:NULLABLE,line_cost_usd:FLOAT:NULLABLE,line_number:INTEGER:NULLABLE,line_revenue_usd:FLOAT:NULLABLE,order_date:DATE:NULLABLE,order_id:STRING:NULLABLE,ordered_at:TIMESTAMP:NULLABLE,person_id:STRING:NULLABLE,price_usd:FLOAT:NULLABLE,quantity:INTEGER:NULLABLE,session_key:STRING:NULLABLE,source:STRING:NULLABLE,unit_cost_usd:FLOAT:NULLABLE", "sum_fp": "328745309287595321588", "xor_fp": "-5383937310389835766"}, "tagline_marts.fct_orders": {"columns": 23, "fingerprint": "5381:-2085543411663503005:-416526920459930681945", "float_digits": null, "rows": 5381, "schema": "duplicate_purchase_events:INTEGER:NULLABLE,has_transaction_id:BOOLEAN:NULLABLE,identity_rule:STRING:NULLABLE,is_transaction_id_collision:BOOLEAN:NULLABLE,is_zero_value_without_id:BOOLEAN:NULLABLE,item_quantity:INTEGER:NULLABLE,line_count:INTEGER:NULLABLE,order_date:DATE:NULLABLE,order_id:STRING:NULLABLE,ordered_at:TIMESTAMP:NULLABLE,person_id:STRING:NULLABLE,purchase_event_key:INTEGER:NULLABLE,revenue_usd:FLOAT:NULLABLE,session_campaign:STRING:NULLABLE,session_date:DATE:NULLABLE,session_key:STRING:NULLABLE,session_medium:STRING:NULLABLE,session_source:STRING:NULLABLE,shipping_usd:FLOAT:NULLABLE,source:STRING:NULLABLE,t